%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed70aee8cc8cd4f8ca7ec0b6c7dc5db3, type: 3}
  m_Name: BeforeMorningDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Northbound.Runtime::Northbound.Dialogue.DialogueAsset
  id: before_morning_dialogue
  lines:
  - speakerId:
    presentation: 1
    text: On the rooftop, Jamie chose the promise. The second key now feels like its weight made metal.
    textChinese: 在屋顶上，杰米选择了守约。如今，第二把钥匙像是把那份承诺的重量变成了金属。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: story_mark_ch3_a
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 3
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    presentation: 1
    text: On the rooftop, Jamie refused to make either side surrender. Three lit doorways still ask what that balance costs.
    textChinese: 在屋顶上，杰米拒绝逼任何一边投降。三扇亮着灯的门仍在追问，这份平衡需要付出什么。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: story_mark_ch3_b
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 3
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    presentation: 1
    text: On the rooftop, Jamie defended everyone's right to change. Now Jamie has to claim that right too.
    textChinese: 在屋顶上，杰米捍卫了每个人改变心意的权利。现在，杰米也必须为自己作出选择。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact: story_mark_ch3_c
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 3
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    presentation: 1
    text: Maya's studio, Noah's radio shop, and Leo's diner are still lit. There is time to visit, but not to make anyone else's decision.
    textChinese: 玛雅的工作室、诺亚的电器店和利奥的餐馆仍亮着灯。还有时间去见他们，但不能替任何人做决定。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    presentation: 1
    text: What will Jamie carry into these final visits?
    textChinese: 杰米将带着怎样的答案，走进天亮前最后的三次见面？
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices:
    - text: I am still going north. I will ask them to keep the promise with me.
      textChinese: 我仍然要去北方。我会请他们和我一起守住约定。
      grantedFact: story_mark_ch4_a
      counterDeltas:
      - id: tendency_commitment
        amount: 12
      - id: tendency_rootedness
        amount: -4
      - id: tendency_agency
        amount: -2
      - id: bond_elias
        amount: 3
      nextLineIndex: 5
    - text: Staying and leaving are not opposite answers to a test. I will not call either one wrong.
      textChinese: 留下和离开，不是一道题的正反答案。我不会把任何一种选择说成错误。
      grantedFact: story_mark_ch4_b
      counterDeltas:
      - id: tendency_commitment
        amount: 3
      - id: tendency_rootedness
        amount: 5
      - id: tendency_agency
        amount: 5
      - id: bond_elias
        amount: 1
      - id: bond_maya
        amount: 1
      - id: bond_noah
        amount: 1
      - id: bond_leo
        amount: 1
      nextLineIndex: 6
    - text: Each of us should choose the life that fits, even if our roads separate.
      textChinese: 每个人都该选择真正适合自己的生活，哪怕我们的路会因此分开。
      grantedFact: story_mark_ch4_c
      counterDeltas:
      - id: tendency_commitment
        amount: -6
      - id: tendency_rootedness
        amount: 2
      - id: tendency_agency
        amount: 12
      - id: bond_maya
        amount: 2
      - id: bond_noah
        amount: 2
      - id: bond_leo
        amount: 2
      nextLineIndex: 7
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: Then I will say goodbye without pretending the plan disappeared.
    textChinese: 那我会认真道别，也不会假装原来的计划已经消失。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 8
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    presentation: 1
    text: The northbound road and the three lit doorways remain visible at the same time.
    textChinese: 向北的路和三扇亮着灯的门，同时留在杰米的视野里。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 8
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Jamie
    text: Then these visits are not votes. They are a chance to hear what each person actually wants.
    textChinese: 那么，这三次见面就不是投票，而是一次真正听见每个人想要什么的机会。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 8
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    presentation: 1
    text: Jamie starts with the nearest light. Morning can wait until every friend has answered for themselves.
    textChinese: 杰米走向最近的那盏灯。等每个朋友都替自己回答以后，清晨再来。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
